     b.      the other shareholders or partners are obliged to provide support to the extent
             of their proportionate share and are legally and financially capable of fulfilling
             that obligation.
3 Participations that are exempt from the consolidation requirement in accordance
with paragraph 1 shall be subject to the corresponding deduction approach without
application of a threshold.

